# Thunderbird -- mail, as a Flatpak (DN-26 pattern, same as Zoom and Joplin).
#
# Moved out of the image on 2026-09-04. The RPM is 381 MB on disk and, measured
# with zstd -19 on the RC1f guest, 131 MB of finished ISO. The release has to
# fit under R2's 5 GiB single-upload ceiling and most advisors use webmail, so
# a mail client that installs itself after first boot is the better trade.
#
# THE APP ID IS NOT THE SAME AS THE RPM'S. Fedora's package ships
# net.thunderbird.Thunderbird.desktop; Flathub publishes org.mozilla.Thunderbird.
# Verified against the Flathub API on 2026-09-04: org.mozilla.Thunderbird
# returns "Thunderbird", and net.thunderbird.Thunderbird returns nothing at all.
# Every reference that used to name the RPM's id -- the mailto handler, the
# taskbar pin, the menu favourite -- was repointed at this one.
#
# Branch is NOT optional. Omit it and flatpak defaults to the "master" branch,
# which does not exist for this app, and preinstall silently reports
# "Nothing to do" -- the trap already recorded for Zoom.
[Flatpak Preinstall org.mozilla.Thunderbird]
Branch=stable
IsRuntime=false
Install=true
